# cloak/halfcape: the HALF-CAPE (FORGE-MANTLE, round 2; STYLE_P2 28.3's over-layer HALFCAPE, contracts 3c `role cloak
# halfcape`): a short cape over the LEFT shoulder to the waist, in the Cloak colour (the paludamentum, a plaid half-cape,
# a reed or fur cape by the people's colour). Asymmetric: facing down it hangs behind the left side, its outer edge lower;
# facing up it covers the back's left half from under the pauldron, its hem rising inward; facing right and left it is a
# narrow cloth 3-4 px behind the back. Vertical folds, a slanted hem. It rides the hang channel (keys derived by
# FORGE-MANTLE gen/halfcape2.py from the rest drawings: wide kicks the hem back, flare lifts and streams it). Finish: R the hem is its
# lowest row of T. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role cloak halfcape
layer cloakBack
anchor neck
keys hang
sway 2
legend Q cloak 0
legend R cloak 1
legend S cloak 2
legend T cloak 3
legend U cloak 4

view D key rest origin 0 2
|QQQQQQQ......
|QSSSSSSQQ....
|QSSSSSSSSQ...
|QSSSSSSSSSSQ.
|QSSSSSSSTSTQ.
|QSSSSSSSTSTQ.
|QSSSSSSSTRSRQ
|QSSSSSSSTRSRQ
|QSSSSSSSTRSRQ
|QSSSSSSSTRSRQ
|QSSSSSSSTRTRQ
|QRRRSSSSTRTRQ
|QQQQRRRRTRTRQ
|....QQQQRRTRQ
|........QQRSQ
|..........QSQ
